{"id":105,"name":"الفيل","transliteration":"Al-Fil","translation_fr":"L'éléphant","translation_en":"The Elephant","type":"meccan","total_verses":5,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ كَيۡفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡفِيلِ","translation_fr":"N'as-tu pas vu comment ton Seigneur a agi envers les gens de l'Eléphant","translation_en":"Have you not considered, [O Muhammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant","transliteration":"Alam tara kayfa faAAala rabbuka biashabi alfeeli"},{"id":2,"text":"أَلَمۡ يَجۡعَلۡ كَيۡدَهُمۡ فِي تَضۡلِيلٖ","translation_fr":"N'a-t-Il pas rendu leur ruse complètement vaine","translation_en":"Did He not make their plan into misguidance","transliteration":"Alam yajAAal kaydahum fee tadleelin"},{"id":3,"text":"وَأَرۡسَلَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ طَيۡرًا أَبَابِيلَ","translation_fr":"et envoyé sur eux des oiseaux par volées","translation_en":"And He sent against them birds in flocks","transliteration":"Waarsala AAalayhim tayran ababeela"},{"id":4,"text":"تَرۡمِيهِم بِحِجَارَةٖ مِّن سِجِّيلٖ","translation_fr":"qui leur lançaient des pierres d'argile","translation_en":"Striking them with stones of hard clay","transliteration":"Tarmeehim bihijaratin min sijjeelin"},{"id":5,"text":"فَجَعَلَهُمۡ كَعَصۡفٖ مَّأۡكُولِۭ","translation_fr":"Et Il les a rendus semblables à une paille mâchée","translation_en":"And He made them like eaten straw","transliteration":"FajaAAalahum kaAAasfin makoolin"}]}